<speak>Yes, the room has been quiet, which is a pleasant surprise. Somebody looked through the glass just now, but I waved and they went away. I think the office is learning that a closed door can mean I am actually occupied, not merely waiting to be interrupted. Anyway, I have my notes in front of me, and there is one remaining point I want to give you. Coming back to the order type, please place it as a market order. After that, I can put the notebook away and return to the office properly. I have enjoyed taking a little time to sort out the administrative habits as well; they have been sitting at the back of my mind.</speak>